# authorization-model

Multi-tenant authorization system implementing bail bonds industry-specific access control:

## Role Hierarchy (Importance: 90)
Location: server/src/lib/roles.js

Core roles with descending privileges:
- SuperUser: Cross-county system administration
- Admin: Single county administration 
- DepartmentLead: Department-level management
- Employee: Standard bail agent access
- Sales: Limited prospect/lead access
- BondClient: Defendant-specific portal access

## Department Access Control (Importance: 85)
Location: src/components/auth/AdminUserManagement.tsx

- Department-scoped permissions
- County-level resource isolation
- Multi-department operation capabilities for senior roles
- Agent license verification requirements by department

## Permission Rules (Importance: 80)
Location: src/hooks/auth.js

Business-specific access patterns:
- Bond amount thresholds for approval levels
- County-specific document access restrictions
- Time-based access expiration for temporary agents
- Department-based case assignment rules

## County Authorization (Importance: 85)
Location: src/components/auth/CountyAccess.tsx

- Multi-county operation management
- Cross-county access restrictions
- Jurisdiction-based permission inheritance
- County-specific role limitations

## Agent Compliance (Importance: 75)
Location: src/components/auth/AgentVerification.tsx

- License verification requirements
- County-specific certification tracking
- Automatic access revocation on expired credentials
- Department-based compliance monitoring

